# Profile setup nav — ↑ +N% after every checklist completion

The sidebar **Profile setup** row must show a temporary **↑ +{delta}%** in `#57B769` whenever setup-success percent increases — for **all** checklist steps, not only property access.

Same-tab `localStorage` writes do **not** fire the `storage` event. Completing a step without `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged()` leaves the nav stale.

## Rule

| Completion path | Must call |
|---|---|
| Property access / details / insurance save | `notifyPropertyDetailsChanged` (also notifies progress) |
| Welcome text sent (Residents / resident profile) | `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged` when `sent > 0` |
| Vendor invite / add (roster has vendors) | `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged` |
| Test Email/SMS delivery marked complete | `markSetupSuccessTestDeliveryComplete` → notifies |
| Maintenance prefs / notification settings save | `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged` |

`useSetupSuccessNavHint` must listen to `SETUP_SUCCESS_PROGRESS_CHANGED_EVENT` **and** `PROPERTY_DETAILS_CHANGED_EVENTS`.

## Autofix (Bugbot)

On PR review, if Profile setup fails to flash after any checklist action:

1. Add `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged()` on that completion path (or extend `markSetupSuccessTestDeliveryComplete` / `notifyPropertyDetailsChanged`).
2. Ensure the nav hook listens to `SETUP_SUCCESS_PROGRESS_CHANGED_EVENT`.
3. Keep the gain flash UI: `setupSuccessNavPercentGain` → green **↑ +N%** under Profile setup.
4. Do not rely only on route changes or cross-tab `storage`.

**Note:** Cursor Bugbot runs on pull requests. It does not auto-run while debugging locally — agents must apply this rule when the symptom appears in chat or PR.

## Where it lives

- Event: `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged` / `SETUP_SUCCESS_PROGRESS_CHANGED_EVENT` in `setupSuccessChecklist.ts`
- Listeners: `useSetupSuccessNavHint.ts`, `SetupSuccessCardHost.tsx`
- UI: `AdminSidebar.tsx`

## Do not

- Listen only for property-details events
- Expect same-tab `localStorage` alone to refresh the nav
- Gate the flash on Overview card dismiss
